  "post_content": "<div class=\"_5pbx userContent _3576\" data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;K&quot;}\" id=\"js_ddw\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 19.32px; margin-top: 6px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\n <p style=\"display: inline; font-family: Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\">(12 fotos) Poco despu&eacute;s de las 21.30 horas de este viernes ha ardido un coche nada m&aacute;s aparcarlo la pareja que iba en el mismo junto a la calle La Cossa, a la salida de Onda hacia Tales.&nbsp;</p>\n <p style=\"display: inline; font-family: Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2019/03/ComençaIncendiCarrerLaCossa.jpeg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 325px;\" /></p>\n <p style=\"display: inline; font-family: Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n <p style=\"display: inline; font-family: Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">Los bomberos voluntarios del parque Espad&aacute;n Mijares se han tenido que emplear a fondo por la fuerza de las llamas para que no se expandieran a otros veh&iacute;culos estacionados. Polic&iacute;a Local y Guardia Civil han cortado el tr&aacute;fico, que ha quedado restablecido a las </span></p>\n <p style=\"display: inline; font-family: Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\">22.25 horas. El olor a quemado de neum&aacute;ticos y elementos de pl&aacute;stico o tapicer&iacute;a se pod&iacute;a percibir en toda Onda.</p>\n <p style=\"display: inline; font-family: Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\"></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendicotxecarrerlacossa/comencaincendicarrerlacossa.jpg\" alt=\"comencaincendicarrerlacossa\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendicotxecarrerlacossa/img_6605.jpg\" alt=\"img_6605\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendicotxecarrerlacossa/img_6606.jpg\" alt=\"img_6606\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendicotxecarrerlacossa/img_6607.jpg\" alt=\"img_6607\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendicotxecarrerlacossa/img_6608.jpg\" alt=\"img_6608\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendicotxecarrerlacossa/img_6609.jpg\" alt=\"img_6609\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendicotxecarrerlacossa/img_6610.jpg\" alt=\"img_6610\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendicotxecarrerlacossa/i